<!--
    The themed layer: the same geometry as the foreground, one tint.

    Not a second mark (docs/ux/visual-identity.md §7.1). Three lobes flattened
    to one colour are still three lobes, where a face becomes an inkblot — so
    the colour layer, this one and the reminder's alpha-only silhouette are one
    drawing with different fills. The paler body circle merges into the cluster
    here by design; what survives the flattening is the outline.

    The fill is opaque black because the system tints this layer itself; only
    the alpha is read.
-->
